{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q4822824","formula":"C₁₆H₁₈N₄O₃S","hill":"C16H18N4O3S","elements":["H","C","N","O","S"],"composition":{"C":16.0,"H":18.0,"N":4.0,"O":3.0,"S":1.0},"names":{"en":"Tenatoprazole","ru":"Тенатопразол"},"descriptions":{"en":"Tenatoprazole is a proton pump inhibitor drug candidate that was undergoing clinical testing as a potential treatment for reflux oesophagitis and peptic ulcer as far back as 2003. The compound was invented by Mitsubishi Tanabe Pharma and was licensed to Negma Laboratories (part of Wockhardt as of 2007). Mitsubishi reported that tenatoprazole was still in Phase I clinical trials in 2007 and again in 2012.","ru":"Тенатопразол является кандидатом в ингибиторы протонной помпы, ещё в 2003 году он проходил клинические испытания в качестве потенциального средства для лечения рефлюкс-эзофагита и язвенной болезни . Лекарственное соединение было изобретено фармацевтической компанией Mitsubishi Tanabe Pharma и лицензировано Negma Laboratories (часть фармацевтической компании Wockhardt с 2007 г. )."},"fame":11,"pubchemCid":636411,"mass":346.4,"charge":0,"smiles":"CC1=CN=C(C(=C1OC)C)CS(=O)C2=NC3=C(N2)C=CC(=N3)OC","inchikey":"ZBFDAUIVDSSISP-UHFFFAOYSA-N","iupac":"5-methoxy-2-[(4-methoxy-3,5-dimethyl-2-pyridinyl)methylsulfinyl]-1H-imidazo[4,5-b]pyridine","classes":[{"qid":"Q113145171","names":{"en":"type of chemical entity","ru":"тип химического объекта","uk":"тип хімічної сутності"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"molecule","source":"pubchem","ref":"636411","atoms":42,"license":"PubChem (NIH), public data"},"structure":{"kind":"molecule","atoms":[{"x":-0.295,"y":-1.209,"z":-0.761,"el":"S"},{"x":-5.437,"y":1.325,"z":-1.063,"el":"O"},{"x":-0.581,"y":-2.622,"z":-0.291,"el":"O"},{"x":6.417,"y":1.569,"z":0.603,"el":"O"},{"x":2.441,"y":-1.782,"z":-0.73,"el":"N"},{"x":-3.033,"y":-1.08,"z":1.331,"el":"N"},{"x":1.915,"y":0.298,"z":-0.131,"el":"N"},{"x":4.18,"y":1.069,"z":0.279,"el":"N"},{"x":-2.515,"y":-0.167,"z":0.484,"el":"C"},{"x":-1.016,"y":